This project implements the Scout Intent specification published by Meterless
(https://github.com/Meterless/Meterless/tree/main/engines/scout-intent), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. Confidence bands, formula weights, the execution-contract shape, eval metric
definitions and thresholds follow that specification. The 10 prompts tagged "meterless-v1" in
evals/scout/injection.jsonl are taken from its evals/regression-set/v1/injection/adversarial.jsonl.

Map data in the pre-existing web/index.html: OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL) via OpenFreeMap tiles.
Street names in data/ come from OpenStreetMap (ODbL). Route and risk values in data/ are a hand-made sample.
